# Loxodon Eavesdropper {3}{G}, a 3/3: "When this creature enters, investigate" and "Whenever you draw your second card each turn, this creature gets
# +1/+1 and gains vigilance until end of turn" (CR 121.1, 603.2, 611.2a, 701.16a). Cast on turn 1 off a Forest and Black Lotus it brings a Clue.
# On turn 3 the draw step's card is only Bot1's first: still a 3/3 with no vigilance. Sacrificing the Clue for {2} draws the second card: a 4/4 with
# vigilance, so it attacks and stays untapped, and Bot2 takes 4. On turn 5 the effect has ended: a 3/3 with no vigilance, tapped by attacking.

